spice
* Transistors
M3 5 4 3 3 NMOS
M4 3 1 2 2 NMOS

* BJTs
Q1 5 8 0 NPN
Q2 3 6 0 NPN

* Resistor
R1 3 4 R1_VALUE

* Current Source
I_PTAT 2 0 DC I_VALUE

* Voltage Source
VDD 2 0 DC VDD_VALUE

* Other component values can be defined as .PARAM or directly replaced here
.PARAM R1_VALUE=1k
.PARAM I_VALUE=1u
.PARAM VDD_VALUE=5V

.END